sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Member
    participant UI as Mobile Member UI
    participant API as Member API
    participant Scope as Identity, ownership, tenant and site checks
    participant Req as Registration request service
    participant Review as Tenant reviewer service
    participant Persist as Affiliation and registration persistence
    participant Audit as Lifecycle audit
    participant Outbox as Notification outbox
    participant QR as Visit-pass issuer and verifier

    alt Save draft and attachments
        M->>UI: Edit registration draft
        UI->>API: PATCH owned draft with If-Match version
        API->>Scope: Verify Member and request or vehicle ownership
        Scope-->>API: Permit owned draft
        API->>Req: Validate fields and requirements version
        Req-->>API: Saved draft, version, last-saved time
        API-->>UI: Durable draft state
        M->>UI: Upload evidence file
        UI->>API: Upload attachment
        API->>Scope: Reverify owned editable draft
        alt Size, MIME, scan, or storage failure
            API-->>UI: 413, 415, 422, or 503 with FAILED attachment
            UI-->>M: Preserve draft and other files; Retry or Remove this file
        else Attachment accepted
            API-->>UI: UPLOADING then SCANNING then READY metadata
        end
    else Submit or resubmit
        M->>UI: Review organization, site, owned vehicle, requirements, and READY evidence
        UI->>API: Submit request with version and Idempotency-Key
        API->>Scope: Verify Member, vehicle ownership, eligible site, and request ownership
        Scope-->>API: Permit submission
        API->>Req: Validate DRAFT or REJECTED revision, requirements, files, and idempotency
        alt Stale, changed requirements, or invalid evidence
            Req-->>API: 409 or 422
            API-->>UI: Preserve compatible draft and require review
        else Valid submission
            Req->>Audit: Append submission lifecycle audit
            Audit->>Outbox: Persist required notification event
            alt Audit or outbox enqueue fails
                Outbox-->>Req: Fail transaction
                Req-->>API: Submission not completed
                API-->>UI: Keep draft or prior rejected state; no false PENDING
            else Durable submission
                Outbox-->>Req: Audit and correlation reference
                Req-->>API: PENDING request, revision, version, audit result
                API-->>UI: Confirmed PENDING state
            end
        end
    else Reviewer decision
        Review->>Scope: Verify Tenant Admin or Site Manager review scope and request site
        Scope-->>Review: Permit scoped review
        alt Approve
            Review->>Req: Revalidate PENDING request, Member vehicle ownership, requirements, files, version
            Req->>Persist: Create or reactivate affiliation and site registration
            Persist->>Req: Registration identity and status
            Req->>Audit: Mark APPROVED and write lifecycle audit in same transaction
            Audit->>Outbox: Persist approval notification event
            alt Affiliation, registration, audit, or outbox enqueue fails
                Outbox-->>Review: Roll back entire approval
                Review-->>UI: Prior PENDING state remains authoritative
            else Approval durable
                Outbox-->>Review: Registration, request version, audit and correlation reference
                Review-->>UI: APPROVED result
            end
        else Reject
            Review->>Req: Require public rejection reason and current PENDING version
            Req->>Audit: Mark REJECTED and persist audit/outbox atomically
            Audit-->>Review: REJECTED result with reason and reference
            Review-->>UI: Member may edit next draft revision and resubmit
        else Suspend or reactivate
            Review->>Req: Require current APPROVED or SUSPENDED registration and reason policy
            Req->>Persist: Change only the target site registration status
            Persist->>Audit: Persist lifecycle audit and required outbox event
            Audit-->>Review: SUSPENDED or APPROVED result with reference
            Review-->>UI: Updated lifecycle; unrelated affiliations and registrations unchanged
        end
    else Create or receive Visit pass
        M->>UI: Choose eligible site, owned vehicle, validity, or enter opaque claim code
        UI->>API: Create or claim pass with Idempotency-Key
        API->>Scope: Verify Member ownership, site eligibility, code, scope, and validity window
        alt Invalid, expired, reused, or cross-owner code
            Scope-->>API: Non-disclosing 404, 409, or 422
            API-->>UI: Generic unavailable or invalid outcome
        else Eligible
            Scope-->>API: Permit pass operation
            API->>QR: Persist scoped pass without exposing bearer token
            QR-->>API: Pass ID, lifecycle, scope, and version
            API-->>UI: ISSUED or ACTIVE pass
        end
    else Request QR presentation
        M->>UI: Open active owned Visit pass
        UI->>API: Request presentation token
        API->>Scope: Verify owner, pass state, version, site, gate and direction scope
        Scope->>QR: Issue opaque 90-second token
        QR-->>API: Token and explicit expiresAt
        API-->>UI: QR presentation and countdown
        alt Device goes offline before token expiry
            UI-->>M: Continue display only until expiresAt with Offline label
        else Token expires offline
            UI-->>M: Hide QR and show Expired reconnect to refresh
        else Online refresh at 45 seconds
            UI->>API: Request next token after revalidation
        end
    else Claim parking session
        M->>UI: Enter opaque single-use claim code
        UI->>API: Claim parking session
        API->>Scope: Verify hashed code, open session, expiry, and unclaimed state
        alt UUID, expired, reused, or unavailable code
            Scope-->>API: Generic failure without enumeration
            API-->>UI: Claim not completed
        else Valid code
            Scope-->>API: Permit one claim
            API-->>UI: Owned session without raw JTI credential
        end
    end

    Note over M,Outbox: Draft or Pending never creates an active tenant registration or affiliation.
    Note over Audit,Outbox: Required outbox enqueue failure rolls back lifecycle transition; later delivery failure retries asynchronously.
    Note over UI,QR: No protected mutation is queued offline or replayed automatically after session expiry or reconnect.
